{title: Jiye To Jiye Kaise}
{artist: Saajan S P Balsubramaniam Kumar Sanu Nadeem Saajan91 Pankaj Udhas}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]jiye [Am]to jiye [F]kaise [C]bin aapke
[C]jiye [Am]to jiye [F]kaise [C]bin aapke
[C]lagta [Am]nahi dil [F]kahin [C]bin aapke
[G]kaise kahu [C]bina tere [G]jindagi ye [F]kya hogi
[G]kaise kahu [C]bina tere [G]jindagi ye [F]kya hogi
[G]jaise koi [F]saza koi [C]bad-dua hogi
[G]jaise koi [F]saza koi [C]bad-dua hogi
[C]meine kiya hai yeh faisla
[G]jeena nahi [C]hai tere bina
[G]muje koi [C]de de zahar [G]hans ke [F]mein pee lungi
[G]muje koi [C]de de zahar [G]hans ke [F]mein pee lungi
[G]har dard sah [F]lungi har haal [C]mein jee lungi
[G]har dard sah [F]lungi har haal [C]mein jee lungi
[C]dard-e judai sah na sakungi
[G]tere bina mein [C]rah na sakungi
[G]dekh ke [C]wo mujhe [G]tera palken [F]juka lena
[G]dekh ke [C]wo mujhe [G]tera palken [F]juka lena
[G]yaad bahut [F]aaye tera [C]muskura dena
[G]yaad bahut [F]aaye wo [C]tera muskura dena
[C]kaise bhulau wo saari baate
[G]wo meethi [C]raate wo mulakate
